  "question": {
    "text": "One end of a straight uniform <math><mn>1</mn><mi></mi><mi>m</mi></math> long bar is pivoted on horizontal table. It is released from rest when it makes an angle <math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math> from the horizontal (see figure). Its angular speed when it hits the table is given as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> , where <math><mi>n</mi></math> is an integer. The value of <math><mi>n</mi></math> is ____________<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0148_372030cbc3f3.jpeg\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
